[[0,1125668,0,91,0,91,"2016-06-22T05:32:20","Greenseats","",[],"","2 Anaheim men found guilty of trying to help the Islamic State","http://www.ocregister.com/articles/attempting-720039-aid-islamic.html","news"],[1,5586284,0,1,0,1,"2016-06-22T06:31:26","icamefromreddityo","",[],"<p>This is interesting. I'll have to re-read when I'm not drunk.</p>\n<p>In principle I think they got caught red-handed trying to get one of them over to Israel to perform a terrorist attack, but what do you guys think? Does this cross some lines of liberty?</p>"],[1,5586288,0,6,0,6,"2016-06-22T06:32:06","wickedkae","",[],"<p>I wonder how many more crimes muslims will have to commit before Americans actually do something... or if Islam will literally take over without any resistance.</p>"],[2,5586797,5586288,3,0,3,"2016-06-22T08:56:41","guinness2","[e]",[],"<p>Given that EVERY Islamic mosque and Imam in the US promotes <a href=\"http://1.bp.blogspot.com/-CYVj3S-4q20/UwAyosD4_sI/AAAAAAAAAHw/DrtmXtqT_p4/s1600/child+marriage+islam.jpg\">raping children,</a> <a href=\"https://iamiranaware.files.wordpress.com/2016/02/violent-koran-verses.jpg\">terrorist attacks</a> and <a href=\"https://i.sli.mg/ZfOW5n.jpg\">murdering Americans...</a> and Americans seem to tolerate that... I suspect Americans will continue to do nothing but grow obese while the Muslim invasion occurs around them.</p>\n<p>I suspect a huge percentage of Americans will even be willing to vote for Hillary Clinton's promoted increase in the number of &quot;mystery meat&quot; members of the Islamic terrorist ideology being rushed into the US while she holds open the door for them.</p>"],[1,5586429,0,3,0,3,"2016-06-22T07:10:59","supdude","[e]",[],"<p>Among the evidence against the men is a video that Badawi made of Elhuzayel pledging allegiance to the leader of Islamic State and announcing his plans to travel to Syria to become a fighter for the terrorist group. The FBI got it's hands on the video and now they are in trouble. </p>\n<p>“This case, if nothing else, should be a clear signal for our young people not to communicate anything online they couldn’t stand by in a courtroom,” Corrigan added. “If you can’t deliver on what you say, don’t say it.”</p>"],[2,5586951,5586429,1,0,1,"2016-06-22T10:04:16","xenopriest","",[],"<p>Was a bit worried about why they were arrested, then I read more and it looks like they were committing back fraud. </p>"],[1,5586680,0,2,0,2,"2016-06-22T08:24:28","ArsCortica","",[],"<p>I'm curious - would this, legally speaking, count as support for a terrorist organization, or as outright treason?</p>"],[1,5594616,0,0,0,0,"2016-06-23T02:13:17","pushthis","",[],"<p>They are there. Why Anaheim idk. Its asking to be pissed off </p>"]]
